      "settings": {
        "anchor": "study-2",
        "title": "Study 2 — The honest meta-analysis",
        "show_image_mobile": false,
        "background_heading": "Study Background",
        "background_text": "Researchers pooled every proper double-blind trial of inositol for mood and anxiety up to 2013 — eleven trials, 312 people. The straight answer: combined, the results didn't reach statistical proof. Slightly more people responded on inositol than placebo, and the strongest signal was in premenstrual mood symptoms — promising in specific groups, not yet proven overall. We'd rather tell you that than oversell it (Mukai et al., 2014).‡",
        "attributes_heading": "Study Attributes",
        "card_bg": "#ffffff",
